{"id":394,"root":"كتم","bw":"ktm","tr":"k-t-m","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\">See Supplement </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَمَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتُمَ</span> </span>, inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتْمٌ</span> [and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كِتْمَانٌ</span>], doubly trans., <em>He concealed,</em> or <em>suppressed,</em> a secret. (Mgh.) ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَمَ الرَّبْوَ</span>: see a verse cited in the last paragraph of art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عور</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَكَتَّمَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> (K, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دلس</span>) <em>He</em> (a man) <em>concealed,</em> or <em>hid, himself.</em> (T, K, same art.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَكَاتَمُوا</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>They practised concealment, one with another:</em> see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَدَافَنُوا</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتُومٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>A strict concealer of secrets.</em> </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَاتِمٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> meaning <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَكْتُومٌ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"a